00:41:54,860 --> 00:41:57,190
更加神秘的东西？
something more mysterious？

845
00:41:57,190 --> 00:41:59,930
我们存在的理由
Do we owe our existence

846
00:41:59,930 --> 00:42:03,100
应该归于我们从未检测到的东西吗？
to something we might never detect？

847
00:42:03,100 --> 00:42:05,230
就现在来说,科学家继续研究
For now,scientists continue to probe

848
00:42:05,230 --> 00:42:08,770
他们成功发现的上帝粒子,
the God particle they have triumphantly discovered,

849
00:42:08,770 --> 00:42:13,040
希望有一天他们能发现答案.
hoping they will one day find out.

850
00:42:13,040 --> 00:42:17,240
希格斯玻色子和我们玩了几十年的
The Higgs boson has been playing a game of hide-and-seek

851
00:42:17,250 --> 00:42:18,340
捉迷藏,
for decades.

852
00:42:18,350 --> 00:42:21,150
现在我们终于发现了它,
Now that we have finally found it,

853
00:42:21,150 --> 00:42:23,350
或是类似于它的东西,
or something like it,

854
00:42:23,350 --> 00:42:27,090
我们的问题比答案更多.
we have more questions than answers.

855
00:42:27,090 --> 00:42:30,620
物理学家每次找到一扇门的钥匙,
Each time physicists find the key to one door,

856
00:42:30,930 --> 00:42:34,090
他们打开门却发现还有另一扇紧锁的门,
they open it just to find,another door.

857
00:42:34,610 --> 00:42:36,480
然后现在,又有五扇门.
And then,five more.

858
00:42:37,210 --> 00:42:40,950
也许希格斯玻色子的确是上帝粒子.
Maybe the Higgs boson really is,God's particle.

859
00:42:41,490 --> 00:42:45,730
一个宇宙谜题的解答,却正是另一个谜题.
A cosmic puzzle whose solution,is just another puzzle.

860
00:42:46,430 --> 00:42:49,490
宇宙留给我们的,注定都是谜题.
Destined to remain,an enigma.

